# .spun find, info, get and update against the test server, through the
# build's default server or through -s and -p.
# get installs the app into C:/APPS through the NextZXOS browser:
# 6 moves down to APPS, ENTER opens it, SPACE chooses it, y confirms.
# ENTER at 30 s answers scroll?. The run fails unless SPUNGETDONE is on
# screen at the end and nothing resets the machine after boot (noreset).
# The last line never ends: a PAUSE 0 there would return at once on the
# key flag that y leaves set, and NextZXOS would show its menu.
put @SPUN@ /dot/SPUN
autostart .spun @OPTS@find "@FIND@"
autostart .spun @OPTS@info @APP@
autostart .spun @OPTS@get @APP@
autostart .spun @OPTS@update
autostart PRINT "SPUNGETDONE"
autostart FOR i=0 TO 1 STEP 0: NEXT i
seconds 60
noreset 7.5
key 16 6
key 18 {ENTER}
key 20 {SPACE}
key 23 y
key 30 {ENTER}
snap 10 15 19 22 25 29 33 40 59
screen 59 SPUNGETDONE
